'''Marley''' was a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife obtained by unboxing it from the [[MLG Box]]. Marley was soon deleted from the game after [[Nikilis]] removed the [[MLG Box]] from the shop due to copyright reasons.
== Appearance ==
The blade on the knife is dark blue, with an orange hilt and a pink handle. The blade of the knife also has an image of Bob Marley on it.

== Trivia ==

* When the [[MLG Box]] was removed and temporarily replaced with the [[Chroma Box]], this knife had its details removed and was renamed [[Plum]].
*This, along with every other item in the [[MLG Box]], was removed from all the player's [[Inventory|inventories]].
*The knife's [https://www.roblox.com/library/161576918/Bob-Knifey texture] was designed by AvidMalignus and was uploaded to Roblox on June 15, 2014.

